4. Asset lifecycle workflow tree
This is how the project's main departments should interact when an asset is purchased, used, transferred, repaired, or disposed of.
1. Procurement

Supplier → Purchase Order → Goods Receipt

2. Asset Registration

Create asset record and unique identifier

3. Warehouse

Store asset → Print QR tag → Issue SIV

4. Assignment

Assign custodian → Acknowledge receipt

5. Active Use

Department or employee uses the asset

6. Monitoring

Maintenance → Transfer → Physical audit

7. Disposal Review

Depreciation → Recommendation → Committee

8. Final Disposition

Approved disposal → Physical action → Record closure